on (Filmistan, Goregaon West) that anchors a Rs. 3,500 cr GDV uber-luxury project. The reported PAT (Rs. 5 cr FY26) is optically crushed by a one-time Rs. 182 cr non-cash diminution of Filmistan tenancy rights — operationally the business grew. Stated pipeline of ~Rs. 12,000 cr over 5–6 years with a launch-driven (Thane + Filmistan) inflection from FY28. Key debate raised by analysts: 25% CAGR alone only gets cumulative revenue to ~Rs. 5,000–6,000 cr over six years, so the thesis leans heavily on the big-ticket launches converting to \"exponential\" growth in FY28/FY29.","trig":[]},"lm":"2025-06","m":2432,"mem":0,"pdd":"","prev_stage":4,"prev_zone_vpe":null,"r":-25.9,"s":"ARKADE","sig":"","sx":{"SMA_50":"130.3","base_count":"","drawdown_from_prev_signal":"","duration_from_prev_signal":"","pct_below_52w_high":"33.0","pct_change_from_prev_signal":"","pivot_close":"","pivot_low":"","stage_changed_since_prev_signal":"","vpe_df_60d_sum":"0.7","vpe_zone_cumul_df":"0.0"},"t":""}},"s":"ARKADE"}